EMA Lightning — Turkish text to speech model and reference engine
  Copyright Canberk Aslan (https://github.com/canberk7). Apache License 2.0.
  https://github.com/canberk7/ema-lightning
  https://huggingface.co/canberkkkkkk/ema-lightning
